{
  "$Comment": [
    "The last step of Old Jack's questline: light the Hollow Lantern. Finishing it earns that year's",
    "keepsake achievement, hallows_eve_lantern_keepsake, which hands over the Hollow Lantern itself.",
    "",
    "Repeat brings this one quest back once a year: the 60-day wait from finishing is longer than",
    "the event and shorter than a year, so a returning player lights a new lantern next October and",
    "earns that year's keepsake without walking the whole questline again. The steps before it never",
    "come back.",
    "",
    "The two Mmo_Xp rows are MMO Skill Tree's, paid only where that mod runs: Defense XP for the",
    "skeletons and the souls the Ectoplasm comes from, and Harvesting XP for the pumpkin, at the rate a",
    "pumpkin step of the questline pays. A server without that mod skips both rows and shows nothing for",
    "them."
  ],
